    "Highlight Priority": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光优先"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Priority protects bright edges. Color Priority also reduces color. Paint Overlay covers the edges evenly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光优先保护亮部边缘。颜色优先还会减少色彩。绘制叠加则均匀覆盖边缘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Recovery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlights": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Histogram": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直方图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold Shift to add or Option to subtract for one outline": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住 Shift 添加，或按住 Option 减去，形成一个轮廓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Horizontal": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "水平"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright the lines are where the picture is black, so they show even over black": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面为黑色时线条的亮度，使线条在黑色上也能显现"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far a color may be from the picked ones and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色与所拾取颜色的最大差异，超过则不选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the screen's lines are": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕线条之间的间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far each color channel (0–255) can differ from the clicked color and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各颜色通道 (0–255) 与点击颜色的最大差异，超过则不选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the blur softens, in pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模糊柔化的范围（像素）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the brightness is smoothed before it displaces the lines, from sharp ridges to rounded hills": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在置换线条前对亮度进行平滑的范围，从尖锐山脊到圆润山丘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the colors spread apart, red one way and blue the other": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色分离的程度，红色向一侧、蓝色向另一侧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long each frame shows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每帧的显示时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个像素的误差扩散到相邻像素的比例。越低，区域越平坦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the gap a bright line fills; dimmer parts draw it thinner": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮线填充间隙的程度；较暗的部分线条更细"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the line's ends, and each of its dashes and dots, are finished": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线条两端以及每一段虚线和圆点的收尾方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HSL": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HSL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HSL lists every color. Color edits one family. Point Color adjusts a color you pick.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HSL 列出所有颜色。颜色用于编辑某一色系。点颜色用于调整你拾取的颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue and saturation of this wheel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此色轮的色相和饱和度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue around the wheel, saturation outward from the center. Control-click to show the histogram.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相绕色轮分布，饱和度由中心向外。Control-点击显示直方图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue Range": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相范围"
          }
